implementationPlan.description:
get_context exposure (tools/getContext.ts, test in tools/finalizeAttempt.test.ts). get_context lists task fields one by one (there is no spread of the task), so without this line WT-11's pre-flight and the resumed worker cannot see landingRetry. In the task projection, directly after `landing: buildLanding(commits),`, add `...(task.landingRetry ? { landingRetry: task.landingRetry } : {}),` with a one-line comment: set by finalize_attempt 'unlanded'; read by the next worker's pre-flight. When the field is absent or null, nothing is added, so every existing payload and its packet id stays byte-identical. Do not role-trim it. Touch nothing else in getContext.ts: WT-02 (a dependency of this task) owns its workspace field.
Test in finalizeAttempt.test.ts, calling `getContextTool(h.state).handler({ taskId: 'task-1' }, h.state)`:
- before any unlanded call, `'landingRetry' in result.task` is false;
- after a conflict unlanded, result.task.landingRetry toEqual the stored record;
- after a later 'landed', the key is absent again.

executionContract.intendedBehavior:
moe.finalize_attempt accepts outcome 'unlanded' for a finalizing attempt whose workspaceMode is 'worktree' (design §2.5). It means the runner's landing published nothing and parked the bytes on the task branch plus rescueRef. The call closes the attempt exactly as today, then routes the task once, in one updateTask write:
- a REVIEW row goes to WORKING, unassigned, with reopenCount, plan steps and stepsCompleted untouched;
- it goes to BLOCKED instead (blockedFromStatus WORKING) when unlandedReason is 'diverged' or this is the 3rd consecutive unlanded finalize;
- a row no longer in REVIEW keeps its status.
Every unlanded call sets Task.landingRetry = {reason, paths, rescueRef, targetTip, count, at}, with count = previous + 1, and appends one 'moe-daemon' task comment naming the reason and paths. 'landed' and 'nothing-to-commit' null an existing landingRetry. get_context's task carries landingRetry when it is set. A shared or legacy attempt, an unknown reason and malformed unlanded params are refused before any write.
